### Application HTTP Requests

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

### ControllerMsgConverter Endpoints

### GET /msg-converter/path0
### Returns: AccountDataModel converted to JSON
GET {{baseUrl}}/msg-converter/path0

### GET /msg-converter/path1
### Returns: URI object converted to QR Code PNG image
### Query parameters:
### - url: String (required) - The URL to convert to QR code
GET {{baseUrl}}/msg-converter/path1?url=https://github.com/

### ControllerArgParser Endpoints

### GET /path0
### Returns: String message with query-string parameter
### Query parameters:
### - nr: Int (optional) - Argument parser converts String to Int
GET {{baseUrl}}/path0?nr=17

### GET /path1/{nr}
### Returns: String message with path parameter
### Path parameters:
### - nr: Int (required) - Argument parser converts String to Int
GET {{baseUrl}}/path1/17

### POST /path2
### Returns: String message with parsed StudentInputModel
### Request body: StudentInputModel (JSON)
### Validation: name length 0-10, year >= 1999
POST {{baseUrl}}/path2
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Ze Rambo",
  "nr": 87236,
  "year": 2019
}

### GET /path3
### Returns: String message with client IP address
### Custom argument resolver: ClientIpArgumentResolver
GET {{baseUrl}}/path3

### ServiceGreetings with Spring Context (Profile-based)

### GET /greeting (Portuguese - Default)
### Returns: Portuguese greeting based on active Spring profile
### Active profile: pt (ServiceGreetingsPt is injected)
### Set in application.properties: spring.profiles.active=pt
GET {{baseUrl}}/greeting

### GET /greeting (English)
### Returns: English greeting based on active Spring profile
### Active profile: en (ServiceGreetingEn is injected)
### To test: change spring.profiles.active=en in application.properties
### Or run with: java -jar app.jar --spring.profiles.active=en
GET {{baseUrl}}/greeting

